WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,540
K1 Special Forces Captain Xu Shaoyang

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,140
I am now the boss of Han

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:08,140
I can't go back, hello, ghost team

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,140
My people, who do you command?

5
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,460
I recognize those who owe you

6
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,020
I want to take them all away

7
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:16,020
Nothing is less than a coincidence

8
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:19,020
None of my people can live without Jin He

9
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,020
One hundred pieces will not be exchanged

10
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,740
one thousand pieces

11
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,020
The captain will not be changed for some time

12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:30,060
It's something I want to keep

13
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,460
I'll keep it for you first

14
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,460
Want to come back anytime

15
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,580
Captain Xie

16
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,580
If you figure it out, leave quickly

17
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,580
The door is blocked elsewhere

18
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:46,860
Pack your things and go down the mountain, sister

19
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:47,860
I'm leaving

20
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:48,860
Don't bully Shaoyang
